flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Init Io.Threaded + bind UDP socket]
    B --> C[Resolve upstream DNS server]
    C --> D{Main loop: receive UDP packet}
    D -->|timeout| D
    D -->|packet| E[Spawn async task]
    E --> F[Decode DNS message]
    F -->|decode error| G[Send FORMERR]
    F -->|ok| H[Build response header + clone questions]
    H --> I{Single question?}
    I -->|no| J[Forward to upstream]
    I -->|yes| K[Cache lookup]
    K -->|hit + valid| L[Clone records, reduce TTLs]
    L --> M[Send response]
    K -->|miss/expired| J
    J -->|timeout/error| N[Send SERVFAIL]
    J -->|ok| O[Decode upstream response]
    O --> P{NOERROR & single question?}
    P -->|yes| Q[Store in cache with stored_at]
    P -->|no| R[Skip cache]
    Q --> S[Clone records, adjust TTLs]
    R --> S
    S --> M
    G --> T[Done]
    N --> T
    M --> T
